silientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:28.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:28.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_iOfaViIVroFaqlqlHCIm3568\",\"name\":\"write_todos\",\"content\":\"Updated todo list to [{'content': 'إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)', 'status': 'in_progress'}, {'content': 'كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:28.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:28.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\nRetry policy with exponential backoff, built for asyncio.\\\\n\\\\nBackoff formula\\\\n===============\\\\n    delay(N) = min(base_delay * multiplier ** (N - 1), max_delay)\\\\n\\\\nwhere N is the 1-based retry number. A random uniform jitter is applied to\\\\navoid the \\\\\\\"thundering herd\\\\\\\" problem when many clients retry simultaneously:\\\\n\\\\n    delay(N) = delay(N) * (1 + uniform(-jitter, +jitter))\\\\n\\\\nUsage\\\\n=====\\\\n    policy = RetryPolicy(max_attempts=4, base_delay=0.2, multiplier=2.0)\\\\n    try:\\\\n        result = await retry(flaky_fn, arg1, arg2, policy=policy)\\\\n    except RetryExhaustedError as e:\\\\n        print(\\\\\\\"last error:\\\\\\\", e.last_exc)\\\\n\\\\nDecorator form:\\\\n    @retryable(max_attempts=5, base_delay=0.1)\\\\n    async def flaky_fn(): ...\\\\n\\\\nOnly exceptions listed in `retry_on` are retried; everything else propagates\\\\nimmediately.\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\\\n\\\\nimport asyncio\\\\nimport logging\\\\nimport random\\\\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\\\\nfrom typing import Any, Awaitable, Callable, Optional, TypeVar\\\\n\\\\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\\\\n\\\\nT = TypeVar(\\\\\\\"T\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nclass RetryExhaustedError(Exception):\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Raised when every retry attempt has failed.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    def __init__(self, attempts: int, last_exc: BaseException)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:29.000Z\",\"endedAt\":null,\"thinkingSeconds\":0,\"stepId\":\"step-1\"}],\"isStreaming\":true,\"isInterrupted\":false,\"generatedFiles\":[],\"conversation_id\":\"1d5a566a-aea8-49f8-9e7a-1d24a5b22643\",\"created_at\":1787625834250,\"fileInfo\":null,\"fileInfos\":null,\"modelValue\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"isAutoModel\":false,\"isStopped\":false,\"creditsUsed\":7}]}}"
