silientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:28.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:28.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_iOfaViIVroFaqlqlHCIm3568\",\"name\":\"write_todos\",\"content\":\"Updated todo list to [{'content': 'إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)', 'status': 'in_progress'}, {'content': 'كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:28.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:28.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\nRetry policy with exponential backoff, built for asyncio.\\\\n\\\\nBackoff formula\\\\n===============\\\\n    delay(N) = min(base_delay * multiplier ** (N - 1), max_delay)\\\\n\\\\nwhere N is the 1-based retry number. A random uniform jitter is applied to\\\\navoid the \\\\\\\"thundering herd\\\\\\\" problem when many clients retry simultaneously:\\\\n\\\\n    delay(N) = delay(N) * (1 + uniform(-jitter, +jitter))\\\\n\\\\nUsage\\\\n=====\\\\n    policy = RetryPolicy(max_attempts=4, base_delay=0.2, multiplier=2.0)\\\\n    try:\\\\n        result = await retry(flaky_fn, arg1, arg2, policy=policy)\\\\n    except RetryExhaustedError as e:\\\\n        print(\\\\\\\"last error:\\\\\\\", e.last_exc)\\\\n\\\\nDecorator form:\\\\n    @retryable(max_attempts=5, base_delay=0.1)\\\\n    async def flaky_fn(): ...\\\\n\\\\nOnly exceptions listed in `retry_on` are retried; everything else propagates\\\\nimmediately.\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\\\n\\\\nimport asyncio\\\\nimport logging\\\\nimport random\\\\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\\\\nfrom typing import Any, Awaitable, Callable, Optional, TypeVar\\\\n\\\\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\\\\n\\\\nT = TypeVar(\\\\\\\"T\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nclass RetryExhaustedError(Exception):\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Raised when every retry attempt has failed.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    def __init__(self, attempts: int, last_exc: BaseException) -> None:\\\\n        self.attempts = attempts\\\\n        self.last_exc = last_exc\\\\n        super().__init__(f\\\\\\\"All {attempts} attempts failed. Last error: {last_exc!r}\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n@dataclass\\\\nclass RetryPolicy:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Configuration for retries with exponential backoff.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    max_attempts: int = 3\\\\n    base_delay: float = 0.1        # seconds before the 1st retry\\\\n    multiplier: float = 2.0        # exponential growth factor (must be > 1)\\\\n    max_delay: float = 10.0        # ceiling for the computed delay\\\\n    jitter: float = 0.1            # uniform jitter as a fraction of the delay\\\\n    retry_on: tuple[type[BaseException], ...] = (Exception,)\\\\n\\\\n    def __post_init__(self) -> None:\\\\n        if self.max_attempts <= 0:\\\\n            raise ValueError(\\\\\\\"max_attempts must be > 0\\\\\\\")\\\\n        if self.base_delay < 0:\\\\n            raise ValueError(\\\\\\\"base_delay must be >= 0\\\\\\\")\\\\n        if self.multiplier <= 1:\\\\n            raise ValueError(\\\\\\\"multiplier must be > 1 for exponential growth\\\\\\\")\\\\n        if self.max_delay < self.base_delay:\\\\n            raise ValueError(\\\\\\\"max_delay must be >= base_delay\\\\\\\")\\\\n        if not 0 <= self.jitter <= 1:\\\\n            raise ValueError(\\\\\\\"jitter must be in [0, 1]\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    def delay_for(self, retry_number: int) -> float:\\\\n        \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Compute the sleep delay before the ``retry_number``-th retry (1-based).\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n        exponential = self.base_delay * (self.multiplier ** (retry_number - 1))\\\\n        capped = min(exponential, self.max_delay)\\\\n        if self.jitter > 0:\\\\n            capped *= 1.0 + random.uniform(-self.jitter, self.jitter)\\\\n        return max(0.0, capped)\\\\n\\\\n    async def sleep(self, retry_number: int) -> None:\\\\n        \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Asynchronously sleep for ``delay_for(retry_number)`` seconds.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n        delay = self.delay_for(retry_number)\\\\n        logger.debug(\\\\\\\"retry #%d sleeping %.3fs\\\\\\\", retry_number, delay)\\\\n        await asyncio.sleep(delay)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nasync def retry(\\\\n    func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]],\\\\n    *args: Any,\\\\n    policy: Optional[RetryPolicy] = None,\\\\n    on_retry: Optional[Callable[[int, BaseException, float], Any]] = None,\\\\n    **kwargs: Any,\\\\n) -> T:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Execute ``func(*args, **kwargs)`` with retries and exponential backoff.\\\\n\\\\n    Returns the result of the first successful attempt. If all attempts fail,\\\\n    raises :class:`RetryExhaustedError` chained from the last exception.\\\\n\\\\n    ``on_retry(retry_number, exception, delay)`` is invoked right before each\\\\n    sleep, useful for logging/metrics.\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    effective = policy if policy is not None else RetryPolicy()\\\\n    last_exc: Optional[BaseException] = None\\\\n\\\\n    for attempt in range(1, effective.max_attempts + 1):\\\\n        try:\\\\n            return await func(*args, **kwargs)\\\\n        except effective.retry_on as exc:\\\\n            last_exc = exc\\\\n            if attempt == effective.max_attempts:\\\\n                break\\\\n            delay = effective.delay_for(attempt)\\\\n            logger.info(\\\\n                \\\\\\\"Attempt %d/%d failed (%r); retrying in %.3fs\\\\\\\",\\\\n                attempt, effective.max_attempts, exc, delay,\\\\n            )\\\\n            if on_retry is not None:\\\\n                on_retry(attempt, exc, delay)\\\\n            await asyncio.sleep(delay)\\\\n\\\\n    # Defensive: if last_exc is None the loop cannot have failed all attempts.\\\\n    assert last_exc is not None\\\\n    raise RetryExhaustedError(effective.max_attempts, last_exc) from last_exc\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef retryable(policy: Optional[RetryPolicy] = None, **policy_kwargs: Any):\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Decorator form of :func:`retry`.\\\\n\\\\n    Example\\\\n    -------\\\\n        @retryable(max_attempts=5, base_delay=0.2, multiplier=2.0)\\\\n        async def flaky_call(): ...\\\\n\\\\n        await flaky_call()            # retried automatically\\\\n        flaky_call.retry_policy       # inspect the policy from outside\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    effective = policy if policy is not None else RetryPolicy(**policy_kwargs)\\\\n\\\\n    def decorator(func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]]) -> Callable[..., Awaitable[T]]:\\\\n        async def wrapper(*args: Any, **kwargs: Any) -> T:\\\\n            return await retry(func, *args, policy=effective, **kwargs)\\\\n\\\\n        wrapper.retry_policy = effective  # type: ignore[attr-defined]\\\\n        wrapper.__name__ = func.__name__\\\\n        wrapper.__doc__ = func.__doc__\\\\n        return wrapper\\\\n\\\\n    return decorator\\\\n\\\", \\\"file_path\\\": \\\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/retry.py\\\"}\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:29.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:38.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":9,\"stepId\":\"step-1\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":8,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:38.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_ET_0g51ZLv2XVGlvKQbcJdQ7975\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nRetry policy with exponential backoff, built for asyncio.\\n\\nBackoff formula\\n===============\\n    delay(N) = min(base_delay * multiplier ** (N - 1), max_delay)\\n\\nwhere N is the 1-based retry number. A random uniform jitter is applied to\\navoid the \\\"thundering herd\\\" problem when many clients retry simultaneously:\\n\\n    delay(N) = delay(N) * (1 + uniform(-jitter, +jitter))\\n\\nUsage\\n=====\\n    policy = RetryPolicy(max_attempts=4, base_delay=0.2, multiplier=2.0)\\n    try:\\n        result = await retry(flaky_fn, arg1, arg2, policy=policy)\\n    except RetryExhaustedError as e:\\n        print(\\\"last error:\\\", e.last_exc)\\n\\nDecorator form:\\n    @retryable(max_attempts=5, base_delay=0.1)\\n    async def flaky_fn(): ...\\n\\nOnly exceptions listed in `retry_on` are retried; everything else propagates\\nimmediately.\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport asyncio\\nimport logging\\nimport random\\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\\nfrom typing import Any, Awaitable, Callable, Optional, TypeVar\\n\\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\\n\\nT = TypeVar(\\\"T\\\")\\n\\n\\nclass RetryExhaustedError(Exception):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Raised when every retry attempt has failed.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    def __init__(self, attempts: int, last_exc: BaseException) -> None:\\n        self.attempts = attempts\\n        self.last_exc = last_exc\\n        super().__init__(f\\\"All {attempts} attempts failed. Last error: {last_exc!r}\\\")\\n\\n\\n@dataclass\\nclass RetryPolicy:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Configuration for retries with exponential backoff.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    max_attempts: int = 3\\n    base_delay: float = 0.1        # seconds before the 1st retry\\n    multiplier: float = 2.0        # exponential growth factor (must be > 1)\\n    max_delay: float = 10.0        # ceiling for the computed delay\\n    jitter: float = 0.1            # uniform jitter as a fraction of the delay\\n    retry_on: tuple[type[BaseException], ...] = (Exception,)\\n\\n    def __post_init__(self) -> None:\\n        if self.max_attempts <= 0:\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"max_attempts must be > 0\\\")\\n        if self.base_delay < 0:\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"base_delay must be >= 0\\\")\\n        if self.multiplier <= 1:\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"multiplier must be > 1 for exponential growth\\\")\\n        if self.max_delay < self.base_delay:\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"max_delay must be >= base_delay\\\")\\n        if not 0 <= self.jitter <= 1:\\n            raise ValueError(\\\"jitter must be in [0, 1]\\\")\\n\\n    def delay_for(self, retry_number: int) -> float:\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"Compute the sleep delay before the ``retry_number``-th retry (1-based).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n        exponential = self.base_delay * (self.multiplier ** (retry_number - 1))\\n        capped = min(exponential, self.max_delay)\\n        if self.jitter > 0:\\n            capped *= 1.0 + random.uniform(-self.jitter, self.jitter)\\n        return max(0.0, capped)\\n\\n    async def sleep(self, retry_number: int) -> None:\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"Asynchronously sleep for ``delay_for(retry_number)`` seconds.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n        delay = self.delay_for(retry_number)\\n        logger.debug(\\\"retry #%d sleeping %.3fs\\\", retry_number, delay)\\n        await asyncio.sleep(delay)\\n\\n\\nasync def retry(\\n    func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]],\\n    *args: Any,\\n    policy: Optional[RetryPolicy] = None,\\n    on_retry: Optional[Callable[[int, BaseException, float], Any]] = None,\\n    **kwargs: Any,\\n) -> T:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Execute ``func(*args, **kwargs)`` with retries and exponential backoff.\\n\\n    Returns the result of the first successful attempt. If all attempts fail,\\n    raises :class:`RetryExhaustedError` chained from the last exception.\\n\\n    ``on_retry(retry_number, exception, delay)`` is invoked right before each\\n    sleep, useful for logging/metrics.\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    effective = policy if policy is not None else RetryPolicy()\\n    last_exc: Optional[BaseException] = None\\n\\n    for attempt in range(1, effective.max_attempts + 1):\\n        try:\\n            return await func(*args, **kwargs)\\n        except effective.retry_on as exc:\\n            last_exc = exc\\n            if attempt == effective.max_attempts:\\n                break\\n            delay = effective.delay_for(attempt)\\n            logger.info(\\n                \\\"Attempt %d/%d failed (%r); retrying in %.3fs\\\",\\n                attempt, effective.max_attempts, exc, delay,\\n            )\\n            if on_retry is not None:\\n                on_retry(attempt, exc, delay)\\n            await asyncio.sleep(delay)\\n\\n    # Defensive: if last_exc is None the loop cannot have failed all attempts.\\n    assert last_exc is not None\\n    raise RetryExhaustedError(effective.max_attempts, last_exc) from last_exc\\n\\n\\ndef retryable(policy: Optional[RetryPolicy] = None, **policy_kwargs: Any):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Decorator form of :func:`retry`.\\n\\n    Example\\n    -------\\n        @retryable(max_attempts=5, base_delay=0.2, multiplier=2.0)\\n        async def flaky_call(): ...\\n\\n        await flaky_call()            # retried automatically\\n        flaky_call.retry_policy       # inspect the policy from outside\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    effective = policy if policy is not None else RetryPolicy(**policy_kwargs)\\n\\n    def decorator(func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]]) -> Callable[..., Awaitable[T]]:\\n        async def wrapper(*args: Any, **kwargs: Any) -> T:\\n            return await retry(func, *args, policy=effective, **kwargs)\\n\\n        wrapper.retry_policy = effective  # type: ignore[attr-defined]\\n        wrapper.__name__ = func.__name__\\n        wrapper.__doc__ = func.__doc__\\n        return wrapper\\n\\n    return decorator\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/retry.py\",\"__result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/retry.py\"},\"result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/retry.py\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:38.000Z\",\"stepId\":\"step-1\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:40.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_ET_0g51ZLv2XVGlvKQbcJdQ7975\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"content\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/retry.py\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:40.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:40.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":8,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:42.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_ET_D9FwolT1VUl99u470Wqz7214\",\"name\":\"write_todos\",\"args\":{\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات\",\"status\":\"pending\"}],\"__result\":\"Updated todo list to [{'content': 'إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'in_progress'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\"},\"result\":\"Updated todo list to [{'content': 'إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'in_progress'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:42.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:42.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_ET_D9FwolT1VUl99u470Wqz7214\",\"name\":\"write_todos\",\"content\":\"Updated todo list to [{'content': 'إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'in_progress'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:42.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:42.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"الآن أكتب طبقة الدمج `protected.py` التي تجمع الـ Circuit Breaker مع الـ Retry في مكوّن واحد:\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:43.000Z\",\"stepId\":\"step-2\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:43.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\nCombine CircuitBreaker + Retry(exponential backoff) into one resilient caller.\\\\n\\\\nDesign / ordering\\\\n=================\\\\nThe retry loop lives OUTSIDE the breaker, so *every* attempt is first checked\\\\nagainst the circuit state:\\\\n\\\\n    request -> [circuit open?] -> [try call] -> [success?] -> return\\\\n                    | fail-fast        |\\\\n                    |                  | failure -> record + retry? (backoff sleep)\\\\n                    ▼                  ▼\\\\n              CircuitOpenError   RetryExhaustedError\\\\n\\\\nThis means:\\\\n* While the breaker is CLOSED   -> attempts run, failures are retried with\\\\n  exponential backoff; if failures trip the breaker to OPEN, the *next*\\\\n  attempt fails fast with CircuitOpenError (no more hammering).\\\\n* While the breaker is OPEN     -> CircuitOpenError is raised immediately.\\\\n* While the breaker is HALF_OPEN -> limited trial calls run; a success closes\\\\n  the breaker, a failure re-opens it.\\\\n\\\\nTimeout\\\\n=======\\\\nAn optional per-call timeout wraps the whole attempt with asyncio.wait_for.\\\\nTimeout errors are treated as retryable (they are subclasses of Exception).\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\\\n\\\\nimport asyncio\\\\nimport logging\\\\nfrom typing import Any, Awaitable, Callable, Optional, TypeVar\\\\n\\\\nfrom .circuit_breaker import CircuitBreaker, CircuitOpenError\\\\nfrom .retry import RetryExhaustedError, RetryPolicy\\\\n\\\\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\\\\n\\\\nT = TypeVar(\\\\\\\"T\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nasync def _call_with_timeout(\\\\n    timeout: float,\\\\n    func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]],\\\\n    *args: Any,\\\\n    **kwargs: Any,\\\\n) -> T:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Run ``func`` guarded by ``asyncio.wait_for``.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    return await asyncio.wait_for(func(*args, **kwargs), timeout=timeout)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nclass ResilientCaller:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"A reusable executor that applies circuit breaking + retry to any coroutine.\\\\n\\\\n    Example\\\\n    -------\\\\n        breaker = CircuitBreaker(name=\\\\\\\"api\\\\\\\", failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=2.0)\\\\n        policy = RetryPolicy(max_attempts=4, base_delay=0.2)\\\\n        caller = ResilientCaller(breaker, policy, timeout=5.0)\\\\n\\\\n        try:\\\\n            data = await caller.execute(http_get, \\\\\\\"/users/1\\\\\\\")\\\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\\\n            data = cached_fallback()\\\\n        except RetryExhaustedError:\\\\n            data = degraded_default()\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    def __init__(\\\\n        self,\\\\n        breaker: CircuitBreaker,\\\\n        retry_policy: RetryPolicy,\\\\n        timeout: Optional[float] = None,\\\\n    ) -> None:\\\\n        self.breaker = breaker\\\\n        self.retry_policy = retry_policy\\\\n        self.timeout = timeout\\\\n\\\\n    async def execute(\\\\n        self,\\\\n        func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]],\\\\n        *args: Any,\\\\n        **kwargs: Any,\\\\n    ) -> T:\\\\n        \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Run ``func(*args, **kwargs)`` protected by breaker + retry/backoff.\\\\n\\\\n        Raises\\\\n        ------\\\\n        CircuitOpenError\\\\n            Circuit is open / no trial slots left -> fail fast.\\\\n        RetryExhaustedError\\\\n            All retry attempts exhausted (last failure chained).\\\\n        \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n        attempts = 0\\\\n        while True:\\\\n            try:\\\\n                if self.timeout is not None:\\\\n                    return await self.breaker.call(\\\\n                        _call_with_timeout, self.timeout, func, *args, **kwargs\\\\n                    )\\\\n                return await self.breaker.call(func, *args, **kwargs)\\\\n            except CircuitOpenError:\\\\n                # Fail fast: do not burn retries against an open circuit.\\\\n                raise\\\\n            except self.retry_policy.retry_on as exc:\\\\n                attempts += 1\\\\n                if attempts >= self.retry_policy.max_attempts:\\\\n                    raise RetryExhaustedError(attempts, exc) from exc\\\\n                delay = self.retry_policy.delay_for(attempts)\\\\n                logger.info(\\\\n                    \\\\\\\"ResilientCaller[%s] attempt %d/%d failed (%r); backing off %.3fs\\\\\\\",\\\\n                    self.breaker.name, attempts, self.retry_policy.max_attempts,\\\\n                    exc, delay,\\\\n                )\\\\n                await asyncio.sleep(delay)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef resilient(\\\\n    *,\\\\n    name: str = \\\\\\\"default\\\\\\\",\\\\n    failure_threshold: int = 5,\\\\n    recovery_timeout: float = 30.0,\\\\n    half_open_max_calls: int = 1,\\\\n    exceptions: tuple[type[BaseException], ...] = (Exception,),\\\\n    max_attempts: int = 3,\\\\n    base_delay: float = 0.1,\\\\n    multiplier: float = 2.0,\\\\n    max_delay: float = 10.0,\\\\n    jitter: float = 0.1,\\\\n    retry_on: tuple[type[BaseException], ...] = (Exception,),\\\\n    timeout: Optional[float] = None,\\\\n):\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Combined decorator: circuit breaker + retry + exponential backoff.\\\\n\\\\n    Example\\\\n    -------\\\\n        @resilient(\\\\n            name=\\\\\\\"payments\\\\\\\",\\\\n            failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=10.0,\\\\n            max_attempts=4, base_delay=0.2, multiplier=2.0,\\\\n            timeout=2.0,\\\\n        )\\\\n        async def charge(card_token: str) -> dict:\\\\n            ...\\\\n\\\\n        try:\\\\n            await charge(\\\\\\\"tok_123\\\\\\\")\\\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\\\n            pass  # use fallback\\\\n        except RetryExhaustedError as e:\\\\n            pass  # last error: e.last_exc\\\\n\\\\n        charge.resilient.breaker.state   # inspect breaker\\\\n        charge.resilient.retry_policy    # inspect policy\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\\\n        name=name,\\\\n        failure_threshold=failure_threshold,\\\\n        recovery_timeout=recovery_timeout,\\\\n        half_open_max_calls=half_open_max_calls,\\\\n        exceptions=exceptions,\\\\n    )\\\\n    policy = RetryPolicy(\\\\n        max_attempts=max_attempts,\\\\n        base_delay=base_delay,\\\\n        multiplier=multiplier,\\\\n        max_delay=max_delay,\\\\n        jitter=jitter,\\\\n        retry_on=retry_on,\\\\n    )\\\\n    caller = ResilientCaller(breaker, policy, timeout=timeout)\\\\n\\\\n    def decorator(func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]]) -> Callable[..., Awaitable[T]]:\\\\n        async def wrapper(*args: Any, **kwargs: Any) -> T:\\\\n            return await caller.execute(func, *args, **kwargs)\\\\n\\\\n        wrapper.resilient = caller  # type: ignore[attr-defined]\\\\n        wrapper.__name__ = func.__name__\\\\n        wrapper.__doc__ = func.__doc__\\\\n        return wrapper\\\\n\\\\n    return decorator\\\\n\\\", \\\"file_path\\\": \\\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/protected.py\\\"}\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:43.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:52.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":9,\"stepId\":\"step-2\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":9,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:52.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_ET_6XKsuPQvXnPzqKawauRk4995\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nCombine CircuitBreaker + Retry(exponential backoff) into one resilient caller.\\n\\nDesign / ordering\\n=================\\nThe retry loop lives OUTSIDE the breaker, so *every* attempt is first checked\\nagainst the circuit state:\\n\\n    request -> [circuit open?] -> [try call] -> [success?] -> return\\n                    | fail-fast        |\\n                    |                  | failure -> record + retry? (backoff sleep)\\n                    ▼                  ▼\\n              CircuitOpenError   RetryExhaustedError\\n\\nThis means:\\n* While the breaker is CLOSED   -> attempts run, failures are retried with\\n  exponential backoff; if failures trip the breaker to OPEN, the *next*\\n  attempt fails fast with CircuitOpenError (no more hammering).\\n* While the breaker is OPEN     -> CircuitOpenError is raised immediately.\\n* While the breaker is HALF_OPEN -> limited trial calls run; a success closes\\n  the breaker, a failure re-opens it.\\n\\nTimeout\\n=======\\nAn optional per-call timeout wraps the whole attempt with asyncio.wait_for.\\nTimeout errors are treated as retryable (they are subclasses of Exception).\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport asyncio\\nimport logging\\nfrom typing import Any, Awaitable, Callable, Optional, TypeVar\\n\\nfrom .circuit_breaker import CircuitBreaker, CircuitOpenError\\nfrom .retry import RetryExhaustedError, RetryPolicy\\n\\nlogger = logging.getLogger(__name__)\\n\\nT = TypeVar(\\\"T\\\")\\n\\n\\nasync def _call_with_timeout(\\n    timeout: float,\\n    func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]],\\n    *args: Any,\\n    **kwargs: Any,\\n) -> T:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Run ``func`` guarded by ``asyncio.wait_for``.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return await asyncio.wait_for(func(*args, **kwargs), timeout=timeout)\\n\\n\\nclass ResilientCaller:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"A reusable executor that applies circuit breaking + retry to any coroutine.\\n\\n    Example\\n    -------\\n        breaker = CircuitBreaker(name=\\\"api\\\", failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=2.0)\\n        policy = RetryPolicy(max_attempts=4, base_delay=0.2)\\n        caller = ResilientCaller(breaker, policy, timeout=5.0)\\n\\n        try:\\n            data = await caller.execute(http_get, \\\"/users/1\\\")\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\n            data = cached_fallback()\\n        except RetryExhaustedError:\\n            data = degraded_default()\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    def __init__(\\n        self,\\n        breaker: CircuitBreaker,\\n        retry_policy: RetryPolicy,\\n        timeout: Optional[float] = None,\\n    ) -> None:\\n        self.breaker = breaker\\n        self.retry_policy = retry_policy\\n        self.timeout = timeout\\n\\n    async def execute(\\n        self,\\n        func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]],\\n        *args: Any,\\n        **kwargs: Any,\\n    ) -> T:\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"Run ``func(*args, **kwargs)`` protected by breaker + retry/backoff.\\n\\n        Raises\\n        ------\\n        CircuitOpenError\\n            Circuit is open / no trial slots left -> fail fast.\\n        RetryExhaustedError\\n            All retry attempts exhausted (last failure chained).\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n        attempts = 0\\n        while True:\\n            try:\\n                if self.timeout is not None:\\n                    return await self.breaker.call(\\n                        _call_with_timeout, self.timeout, func, *args, **kwargs\\n                    )\\n                return await self.breaker.call(func, *args, **kwargs)\\n            except CircuitOpenError:\\n                # Fail fast: do not burn retries against an open circuit.\\n                raise\\n            except self.retry_policy.retry_on as exc:\\n                attempts += 1\\n                if attempts >= self.retry_policy.max_attempts:\\n                    raise RetryExhaustedError(attempts, exc) from exc\\n                delay = self.retry_policy.delay_for(attempts)\\n                logger.info(\\n                    \\\"ResilientCaller[%s] attempt %d/%d failed (%r); backing off %.3fs\\\",\\n                    self.breaker.name, attempts, self.retry_policy.max_attempts,\\n                    exc, delay,\\n                )\\n                await asyncio.sleep(delay)\\n\\n\\ndef resilient(\\n    *,\\n    name: str = \\\"default\\\",\\n    failure_threshold: int = 5,\\n    recovery_timeout: float = 30.0,\\n    half_open_max_calls: int = 1,\\n    exceptions: tuple[type[BaseException], ...] = (Exception,),\\n    max_attempts: int = 3,\\n    base_delay: float = 0.1,\\n    multiplier: float = 2.0,\\n    max_delay: float = 10.0,\\n    jitter: float = 0.1,\\n    retry_on: tuple[type[BaseException], ...] = (Exception,),\\n    timeout: Optional[float] = None,\\n):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Combined decorator: circuit breaker + retry + exponential backoff.\\n\\n    Example\\n    -------\\n        @resilient(\\n            name=\\\"payments\\\",\\n            failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=10.0,\\n            max_attempts=4, base_delay=0.2, multiplier=2.0,\\n            timeout=2.0,\\n        )\\n        async def charge(card_token: str) -> dict:\\n            ...\\n\\n        try:\\n            await charge(\\\"tok_123\\\")\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\n            pass  # use fallback\\n        except RetryExhaustedError as e:\\n            pass  # last error: e.last_exc\\n\\n        charge.resilient.breaker.state   # inspect breaker\\n        charge.resilient.retry_policy    # inspect policy\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\n        name=name,\\n        failure_threshold=failure_threshold,\\n        recovery_timeout=recovery_timeout,\\n        half_open_max_calls=half_open_max_calls,\\n        exceptions=exceptions,\\n    )\\n    policy = RetryPolicy(\\n        max_attempts=max_attempts,\\n        base_delay=base_delay,\\n        multiplier=multiplier,\\n        max_delay=max_delay,\\n        jitter=jitter,\\n        retry_on=retry_on,\\n    )\\n    caller = ResilientCaller(breaker, policy, timeout=timeout)\\n\\n    def decorator(func: Callable[..., Awaitable[T]]) -> Callable[..., Awaitable[T]]:\\n        async def wrapper(*args: Any, **kwargs: Any) -> T:\\n            return await caller.execute(func, *args, **kwargs)\\n\\n        wrapper.resilient = caller  # type: ignore[attr-defined]\\n        wrapper.__name__ = func.__name__\\n        wrapper.__doc__ = func.__doc__\\n        return wrapper\\n\\n    return decorator\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/protected.py\",\"__result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/protected.py\"},\"result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/protected.py\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:52.000Z\",\"stepId\":\"step-2\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:53.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_ET_6XKsuPQvXnPzqKawauRk4995\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"content\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/circuit_breaker/protected.py\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:53.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:53.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"Now the example demo and requirements.txt. Let me write examples/demo.py.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:54.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:55.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":1,\"stepId\":\"step-2\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":10,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:55.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_KZPEoTTwwb7XUghcObMS2049\",\"name\":\"write_todos\",\"args\":{\"todos\":[{\"content\":\"إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات\",\"status\":\"pending\"}],\"__result\":\"Updated todo list to [{'content': 'إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'in_progress'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\"},\"result\":\"Updated todo list to [{'content': 'إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'in_progress'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:55.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:55.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_KZPEoTTwwb7XUghcObMS2049\",\"name\":\"write_todos\",\"content\":\"Updated todo list to [{'content': 'إنشاء هيكل المشروع وكتابة النواة: CircuitBreaker (circuit_breaker.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff (retry.py)', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة طبقة الدمج ResilientCaller والديكورات (protected.py) + ملفات الدعم', 'status': 'completed'}, {'content': 'كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)', 'status': 'in_progress'}, {'content': 'كتابة اختبارات وحدة شاملة (tests/)', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'تشغيل الاختبارات والمثال والتحقق من سلامة الكود', 'status': 'pending'}, {'content': 'كتابة README بالعربية ورفع جميع الملفات', 'status': 'pending'}]\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:55.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:55.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\nمثال تشغيلي كامل: خدمة غير مستقرة + Retry مع Exponential Backoff + Circuit Breaker.\\\\n\\\\nالتشغيل:\\\\n    python3 examples/demo.py\\\\n\\\\nيتم عرض ثلاث سيناريوهات:\\\\n  1) Retry فقط (بدون قاطع دائرة)\\\\n  2) Circuit Breaker فقط (بدون retry) -> يفتح، يرفض بسرعة، ثم يغلق بعد Half-Open\\\\n  3) التوليفة الكاملة: CircuitBreaker + Retry + Exponential Backoff (ResilientCaller)\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\\\n\\\\nimport asyncio\\\\nimport logging\\\\nimport random\\\\nimport time\\\\n\\\\n# السماح باستيراد الحزمة من جذر المشروع\\\\nimport sys\\\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\\\n\\\\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent))\\\\n\\\\nfrom circuit_breaker import (\\\\n    CircuitBreaker,\\\\n    CircuitOpenError,\\\\n    CircuitState,\\\\n    ResilientCaller,\\\\n    RetryExhaustedError,\\\\n    RetryPolicy,\\\\n)\\\\n\\\\nlogging.basicConfig(\\\\n    level=logging.INFO,\\\\n    format=\\\\\\\"%(asctime)s | %(levelname)-7s | %(message)s\\\\\\\",\\\\n    datefmt=\\\\\\\"%H:%M:%S\\\\\\\",\\\\n)\\\\nlog = logging.getLogger(\\\\\\\"demo\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nclass FlakyService:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"محاكاة خدمة خارجية (API) بطيئة وتفشل بشكل عشوائي.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    def __init__(self, failure_rate: float = 0.55, min_latency: float = 0.01,\\\\n                 max_latency: float = 0.06, seed: int = 42) -> None:\\\\n        self.failure_rate = failure_rate\\\\n        self.min_latency = min_latency\\\\n        self.max_latency = max_latency\\\\n        self.calls = 0\\\\n        self.failures = 0\\\\n        random.seed(seed)  # نتائج قابلة لإعادة الإنتاج\\\\n\\\\n    async def request(self, endpoint: str) -> dict:\\\\n        self.calls += 1\\\\n        await asyncio.sleep(random.uniform(self.min_latency, self.max_latency))\\\\n        if random.random() < self.failure_rate:\\\\n            self.failures += 1\\\\n            raise ConnectionError(f\\\\\\\"'{endpoint}' فشل (محاولة #{self.calls})\\\\\\\")\\\\n        return {\\\\\\\"endpoint\\\\\\\": endpoint, \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\": True, \\\\\\\"call\\\\\\\": self.calls}\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nasync def scenario_1_retry_only(service: FlakyService) -> None:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"Retry + Exponential Backoff بدون قاطع دائرة.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 62)\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"السيناريو 1: Retry مع Exponential Backoff فقط\\\\\\\")\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 62)\\\\n\\\\n    policy = RetryPolicy(\\\\n        max_attempts=4,\\\\n        base_delay=0.05,\\\\n        multiplier=2.0,\\\\n        max_delay=1.0,\\\\n        jitter=0.1,\\\\n    )\\\\n    delays: list[float] = []\\\\n\\\\n    async def track_retry(attempt: int, exc: BaseException, delay: float) -> None:\\\\n        delays.append(delay)\\\\n        log.info(\\\\\\\"   ↳ محاولة %d فشلت (%r) — انتظار %.3fs قبل إعادة المحاولة\\\\\\\",\\\\n                 attempt, exc, delay)\\\\n\\\\n    try:\\\\n        from circuit_breaker import retry as retry_fn\\\\n\\\\n        result = await retry_fn(\\\\n            service.request, \\\\\\\"/v1/orders\\\\\\\",\\\\n            policy=policy, on_retry=track_retry,\\\\n        )\\\\n        log.info(\\\\\\\"   ✓ نجحت بعد %d محاولة. النتيجة: %s\\\\\\\", len(delays) + 1, result)\\\\n        log.info(\\\\\\\"   التسلسل الزمني للإنتظار (exponential): %s\\\\\\\",\\\\n                 [round(d, 3) for d in delays])\\\\n    except RetryExhaustedError as exc:\\\\n        log.info(\\\\\\\"   ✗ استنفدت كل المحاولات. آخر خطأ: %r\\\\\\\", exc.last_exc)\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"   إجمالي طلبات الخدمة: %d\\\\\\\", service.calls)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nasync def scenario_2_breaker_only(service: FlakyService) -> None:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"قاطع الدائرة فقط: يفتح بعد 3 فشل، يرفض بسرعة، ثم يستعيد عبر Half-Open.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 62)\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"السيناريو 2: Circuit Breaker فقط\\\\\\\")\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 62)\\\\n\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\\\n        name=\\\\\\\"api\\\\\\\",\\\\n        failure_threshold=3,\\\\n        recovery_timeout=0.6,   # يفتح لمدة قصيرة لتبسيط العرض\\\\n        half_open_max_calls=1,\\\\n    )\\\\n\\\\n    def on_change(old: CircuitState, new: CircuitState) -> None:\\\\n        log.info(\\\\\\\"   ⚡ تغيّرت حالة القاطع: %s -> %s\\\\\\\", old.value, new.value)\\\\n\\\\n    breaker.on_state_change(on_change)\\\\n\\\\n    for i in range(8):\\\\n        try:\\\\n            result = await breaker.call(service.request, f\\\\\\\"/v1/items/{i}\\\\\\\")\\\\n            log.info(\\\\\\\"   محاولة #%d: نجاح ✅ %s\\\\\\\", i + 1, result)\\\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\\\n            log.info(\\\\\\\"   محاولة #%d: مرفوضة فوراً (fail-fast) 🚫\\\\\\\", i + 1)\\\\n        except ConnectionError as exc:\\\\n            log.info(\\\\\\\"   محاولة #%d: فشل ❌ (%s)\\\\\\\", i + 1, exc)\\\\n        await asyncio.sleep(0.28)  # مهلة كافية للسماح بانتقال OPEN -> HALF_OPEN\\\\n\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"   الحالة النهائية: %s | إحصائيات: %s\\\\\\\", breaker.state.value, breaker.stats())\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nasync def scenario_3_combined(service: FlakyService) -> None:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"التوليفة الكاملة: قاطع دائرة + retry + backoff في مكوّن واحد.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 62)\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"السيناريو 3: ResilientCaller = CircuitBreaker + Retry + Backoff\\\\\\\")\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 62)\\\\n\\\\n    caller = ResilientCaller(\\\\n        breaker=CircuitBreaker(\\\\n            name=\\\\\\\"payments\\\\\\\",\\\\n            failure_threshold=3,\\\\n            recovery_timeout=0.8,\\\\n            half_open_max_calls=1,\\\\n        ),\\\\n        retry_policy=RetryPolicy(\\\\n            max_attempts=3,\\\\n            base_delay=0.05,\\\\n            multiplier=2.0,\\\\n            jitter=0.05,\\\\n        ),\\\\n        timeout=0.5,\\\\n    )\\\\n\\\\n    async def charge() -> dict:\\\\n        return await service.request(\\\\\\\"/v1/charge\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    for i in range(10):\\\\n        try:\\\\n            result = await caller.execute(charge)\\\\n            log.info(\\\\\\\"   عملية الدفع #%d: نجحت ✅ %s\\\\\\\", i + 1, result)\\\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\\\n            log.info(\\\\\\\"   عملية الدفع #%d: القاطع مفتوح، استخدمنا مساراً بديلاً 🚫\\\\\\\", i + 1)\\\\n        except RetryExhaustedError as exc:\\\\n            log.info(\\\\\\\"   عملية الدفع #%d: استنفدت المحاولات ❌ (%r)\\\\\\\", i + 1, exc.last_exc)\\\\n        await asyncio.sleep(0.22)\\\\n\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"   الحالة النهائية للقاطع: %s\\\\\\\", caller.breaker.state.value)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nasync def main() -> None:\\\\n    start = time.monotonic()\\\\n\\\\n    service = FlakyService(failure_rate=0.55, seed=7)\\\\n    await scenario_1_retry_only(service)\\\\n\\\\n    service = FlakyService(failure_rate=0.55, seed=11)\\\\n    await scenario_2_breaker_only(service)\\\\n\\\\n    service = FlakyService(failure_rate=0.6, seed=13)\\\\n    await scenario_3_combined(service)\\\\n\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 62)\\\\n    log.info(\\\\\\\"انتهى العرض التوضيحي في %.2f ثانية\\\\\\\", time.monotonic() - start)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nif __name__ == \\\\\\\"__main__\\\\\\\":\\\\n    asyncio.run(main())\\\\n\\\", \\\"file_path\\\": \\\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py\\\"}\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:45:57.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:46:07.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":10,\"stepId\":\"step-3\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":11,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:46:07.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_ET_zqykQlpX7gMQ6YvamPbz5181\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nمثال تشغيلي كامل: خدمة غير مستقرة + Retry مع Exponential Backoff + Circuit Breaker.\\n\\nالتشغيل:\\n    python3 examples/demo.py\\n\\nيتم عرض ثلاث سيناريوهات:\\n  1) Retry فقط (بدون قاطع دائرة)\\n  2) Circuit Breaker فقط (بدون retry) -> يفتح، يرفض بسرعة، ثم يغلق بعد Half-Open\\n  3) التوليفة الكاملة: CircuitBreaker + Retry + Exponential Backoff (ResilientCaller)\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport asyncio\\nimport logging\\nimport random\\nimport time\\n\\n# السماح باستيراد الحزمة من جذر المشروع\\nimport sys\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent))\\n\\nfrom circuit_breaker import (\\n    CircuitBreaker,\\n    CircuitOpenError,\\n    CircuitState,\\n    ResilientCaller,\\n    RetryExhaustedError,\\n    RetryPolicy,\\n)\\n\\nlogging.basicConfig(\\n    level=logging.INFO,\\n    format=\\\"%(asctime)s | %(levelname)-7s | %(message)s\\\",\\n    datefmt=\\\"%H:%M:%S\\\",\\n)\\nlog = logging.getLogger(\\\"demo\\\")\\n\\n\\nclass FlakyService:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"محاكاة خدمة خارجية (API) بطيئة وتفشل بشكل عشوائي.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    def __init__(self, failure_rate: float = 0.55, min_latency: float = 0.01,\\n                 max_latency: float = 0.06, seed: int = 42) -> None:\\n        self.failure_rate = failure_rate\\n        self.min_latency = min_latency\\n        self.max_latency = max_latency\\n        self.calls = 0\\n        self.failures = 0\\n        random.seed(seed)  # نتائج قابلة لإعادة الإنتاج\\n\\n    async def request(self, endpoint: str) -> dict:\\n        self.calls += 1\\n        await asyncio.sleep(random.uniform(self.min_latency, self.max_latency))\\n        if random.random() < self.failure_rate:\\n            self.failures += 1\\n            raise ConnectionError(f\\\"'{endpoint}' فشل (محاولة #{self.calls})\\\")\\n        return {\\\"endpoint\\\": endpoint, \\\"ok\\\": True, \\\"call\\\": self.calls}\\n\\n\\nasync def scenario_1_retry_only(service: FlakyService) -> None:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Retry + Exponential Backoff بدون قاطع دائرة.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    log.info(\\\"=\\\" * 62)\\n    log.info(\\\"السيناريو 1: Retry مع Exponential Backoff فقط\\\")\\n    log.info(\\\"=\\\" * 62)\\n\\n    policy = RetryPolicy(\\n        max_attempts=4,\\n        base_delay=0.05,\\n        multiplier=2.0,\\n        max_delay=1.0,\\n        jitter=0.1,\\n    )\\n    delays: list[float] = []\\n\\n    async def track_retry(attempt: int, exc: BaseException, delay: float) -> None:\\n        delays.append(delay)\\n        log.info(\\\"   ↳ محاولة %d فشلت (%r) — انتظار %.3fs قبل إعادة المحاولة\\\",\\n                 attempt, exc, delay)\\n\\n    try:\\n        from circuit_breaker import retry as retry_fn\\n\\n        result = await retry_fn(\\n            service.request, \\\"/v1/orders\\\",\\n            policy=policy, on_retry=track_retry,\\n        )\\n        log.info(\\\"   ✓ نجحت بعد %d محاولة. النتيجة: %s\\\", len(delays) + 1, result)\\n        log.info(\\\"   التسلسل الزمني للإنتظار (exponential): %s\\\",\\n                 [round(d, 3) for d in delays])\\n    except RetryExhaustedError as exc:\\n        log.info(\\\"   ✗ استنفدت كل المحاولات. آخر خطأ: %r\\\", exc.last_exc)\\n    log.info(\\\"   إجمالي طلبات الخدمة: %d\\\", service.calls)\\n\\n\\nasync def scenario_2_breaker_only(service: FlakyService) -> None:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"قاطع الدائرة فقط: يفتح بعد 3 فشل، يرفض بسرعة، ثم يستعيد عبر Half-Open.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    log.info(\\\"=\\\" * 62)\\n    log.info(\\\"السيناريو 2: Circuit Breaker فقط\\\")\\n    log.info(\\\"=\\\" * 62)\\n\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\n        name=\\\"api\\\",\\n        failure_threshold=3,\\n        recovery_timeout=0.6,   # يفتح لمدة قصيرة لتبسيط العرض\\n        half_open_max_calls=1,\\n    )\\n\\n    def on_change(old: CircuitState, new: CircuitState) -> None:\\n        log.info(\\\"   ⚡ تغيّرت حالة القاطع: %s -> %s\\\", old.value, new.value)\\n\\n    breaker.on_state_change(on_change)\\n\\n    for i in range(8):\\n        try:\\n            result = await breaker.call(service.request, f\\\"/v1/items/{i}\\\")\\n            log.info(\\\"   محاولة #%d: نجاح ✅ %s\\\", i + 1, result)\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\n            log.info(\\\"   محاولة #%d: مرفوضة فوراً (fail-fast) 🚫\\\", i + 1)\\n        except ConnectionError as exc:\\n            log.info(\\\"   محاولة #%d: فشل ❌ (%s)\\\", i + 1, exc)\\n        await asyncio.sleep(0.28)  # مهلة كافية للسماح بانتقال OPEN -> HALF_OPEN\\n\\n    log.info(\\\"   الحالة النهائية: %s | إحصائيات: %s\\\", breaker.state.value, breaker.stats())\\n\\n\\nasync def scenario_3_combined(service: FlakyService) -> None:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"التوليفة الكاملة: قاطع دائرة + retry + backoff في مكوّن واحد.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    log.info(\\\"=\\\" * 62)\\n    log.info(\\\"السيناريو 3: ResilientCaller = CircuitBreaker + Retry + Backoff\\\")\\n    log.info(\\\"=\\\" * 62)\\n\\n    caller = ResilientCaller(\\n        breaker=CircuitBreaker(\\n            name=\\\"payments\\\",\\n            failure_threshold=3,\\n            recovery_timeout=0.8,\\n            half_open_max_calls=1,\\n        ),\\n        retry_policy=RetryPolicy(\\n            max_attempts=3,\\n            base_delay=0.05,\\n            multiplier=2.0,\\n            jitter=0.05,\\n        ),\\n        timeout=0.5,\\n    )\\n\\n    async def charge() -> dict:\\n        return await service.request(\\\"/v1/charge\\\")\\n\\n    for i in range(10):\\n        try:\\n            result = await caller.execute(charge)\\n            log.info(\\\"   عملية الدفع #%d: نجحت ✅ %s\\\", i + 1, result)\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\n            log.info(\\\"   عملية الدفع #%d: القاطع مفتوح، استخدمنا مساراً بديلاً 🚫\\\", i + 1)\\n        except RetryExhaustedError as exc:\\n            log.info(\\\"   عملية الدفع #%d: استنفدت المحاولات ❌ (%r)\\\", i + 1, exc.last_exc)\\n        await asyncio.sleep(0.22)\\n\\n    log.info(\\\"   الحالة النهائية للقاطع: %s\\\", caller.breaker.state.value)\\n\\n\\nasync def main() -> None:\\n    start = time.monotonic()\\n\\n    service = FlakyService(failure_rate=0.55, seed=7)\\n    await scenario_1_retry_only(service)\\n\\n    service = FlakyService(failure_rate=0.55, seed=11)\\n    await scenario_2_breaker_only(service)\\n\\n    service = FlakyService(failure_rate=0.6, seed=13)\\n    await scenario_3_combined(service)\\n\\n    log.info(\\\"=\\\" * 62)\\n    log.info(\\\"انتهى العرض التوضيحي في %.2f ثانية\\\", time.monotonic() - start)\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    asyncio.run(main())\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py\"}},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:46:07.000Z\",\"stepId\":\"step-3\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":11,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:46:07.000Z\"}],\"isStreaming\":false,\"isInterrupted\":false,\"generatedFiles\":[],\"conversation_id\":\"1d5a566a-aea8-49f8-9e7a-1d24a5b22643\",\"created_at\":1787625834250,\"fileInfo\":null,\"fileInfos\":null,\"modelValue\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"isAutoModel\":false,\"isStopped\":false,\"creditGuide\":\"trial\",\"creditsUsed\":11},{\"label\":\"2. صمم واكتب كود بايثون متكامل بنظام Asyncio لتطبيق معمارية Circuit Breaker Pattern مع Retry و Exponent\",\"question\":\"2. صمم واكتب كود بايثون متكامل بنظام Asyncio لتطبيق معمارية Circuit Breaker Pattern مع Retry و Exponent\",\"answer\":[\"\"],\"reasoning\":[{\"startedAt\":null,\"endedAt\":null,\"reasoning\":\"\",\"thinkingSeconds\":0}],\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"The user is repeating the same request. I'm in the middle of building the project. Let me continue with the remaining tasks: demo example, tests, run them, README, and upload files.\\n\\nLet me continue from where I was - I marked \\\"كتابة مثال توضيحي تشغيلي (examples/demo.py)\\\" as in_progress. Let me write the demo.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:46:49.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:46:49.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":0},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"متابعة العمل على المشروع — أكتب الآن المثال التوضيحي التشغيلي:\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:46:49.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:46:49.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\nDemo: Circuit Breaker + Retry (Exponential Backoff) مع asyncio.\\\\n\\\\nنحاكي خدمة خارجية غير مستقرة (HTTP API) ونحميها بطبقات المرونة الثلاث:\\\\n  1) Circuit Breaker  -> يوقف الضرب على الخدمة عند تكرار الفشل (fail-fast).\\\\n  2) Retry            -> يعيد المحاولة مع تأخير أُسّي (exponential backoff) + جitter.\\\\n  3) Timeout          -> مهلة زمنية لكل محاولة حتى لا يعلق الطلب للأبد.\\\\n\\\\nشغّل المثال:  python examples/demo.py\\\\n\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nimport asyncio\\\\nimport random\\\\nimport sys\\\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\\\n\\\\n# نضيف جذر المشروع إلى مسار الاستيراد حتى يعمل المثال من أي مكان\\\\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent))\\\\n\\\\nfrom circuit_breaker import (\\\\n    CircuitBreaker,\\\\n    CircuitOpenError,\\\\n    RetryExhaustedError,\\\\n    RetryPolicy,\\\\n    resilient,\\\\n)\\\\n\\\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\\\n# 1) محاكاة خدمة خارجية غير مستقرة\\\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\\\nclass FakePaymentGateway:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"محاكاة بوابة دفع: نسبة فشل عشوائية + أوقات استجابة متفاوتة.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    def __init__(self, failure_rate: float = 0.6, latency: float = 0.3) -> None:\\\\n        self.failure_rate = failure_rate\\\\n        self.latency = latency\\\\n        self.requests = 0\\\\n        self.successes = 0\\\\n\\\\n    async def charge(self, amount: float, currency: str = \\\\\\\"USD\\\\\\\") -> dict:\\\\n        await asyncio.sleep(random.uniform(0.05, self.latency))\\\\n        self.requests += 1\\\\n        if random.random() < self.failure_rate:\\\\n            raise ConnectionError(\\\\\\\"upstream gateway timeout (simulated)\\\\\\\")\\\\n        self.successes += 1\\\\n        return {\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"amount\\\\\\\": amount, \\\\\\\"currency\\\\\\\": currency}\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\\\n# 2) الطريقة الأولى: التجميع اليدوي (CircuitBreaker + RetryPolicy)\\\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\\\nasync def call_with_manual_composition(gateway: FakePaymentGateway) -> None:\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 64)\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"السيناريو (أ): تجميع يدوي — Breaker + RetryPolicy معاً\\\\\\\")\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 64)\\\\n\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\\\n        name=\\\\\\\"gateway-manual\\\\\\\",\\\\n        failure_threshold=3,       # ينفتح الدائرة بعد 3 إخفاقات متتالية\\\\n        recovery_timeout=2.0,      # ينتظر ثانيتين قبل السماح بمحاولة تجريبية\\\\n        half_open_max_calls=2,     # محاولتان تجريبيتان فقط في حالة HALF_OPEN\\\\n    )\\\\n    policy = RetryPolicy(\\\\n        max_attempts=5,            # 5 محاولات كحد أقصى\\\\n        base_delay=0.1,\\\\n        multiplier=2.0,\\\\n        max_delay=1.0,\\\\n        jitter=0.2,\\\\n    )\\\\n\\\\n    breaker.on_state_change(\\\\n        lambda old, new: print(f\\\\\\\"   ⚡ تغيّرت حالة الدائرة: {old} -> {new}\\\\\\\")\\\\n    )\\\\n\\\\n    attempts = 0\\\\n    while attempts < 12:\\\\n        attempts += 1\\\\n        try:\\\\n            result = await policy_retry_breaker(gateway, breaker, policy)\\\\n            print(f\\\\\\\"   ✓ محاولة #{attempts}: نجحت -> {result}\\\\\\\")\\\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\\\n            print(f\\\\\\\"   ✗ محاولة #{attempts}: CircuitOpenError (fail-fast، لا نلمس الخدمة!)\\\\\\\")\\\\n        except RetryExhaustedError as exc:\\\\n            print(f\\\\\\\"   ✗ محاولة #{attempts}: RetryExhaustedError — آخر خطأ: {exc.last_exc!r}\\\\\\\")\\\\n        print(f\\\\\\\"      [state={breaker.state.value}, failures={breaker.failure_count}]\\\\\\\")\\\\n        await asyncio.sleep(0.3)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nasync def policy_retry_breaker(\\\\n    gateway: FakePaymentGateway,\\\\n    breaker: CircuitBreaker,\\\\n    policy: RetryPolicy,\\\\n) -> dict:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"محاولة واحدة = محاولات Retry تمر كلها عبر الـ Breaker.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    attempts = 0\\\\n    while True:\\\\n        try:\\\\n            return await breaker.call(gateway.charge, 99.5, currency=\\\\\\\"USD\\\\\\\")\\\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\\\n            raise  # الدائرة مفتوحة -> لا نعيد المحاولة، نفشل فوراً\\\\n        except Exception as exc:\\\\n            attempts += 1\\\\n            if attempts >= policy.max_attempts:\\\\n                raise RetryExhaustedError(attempts, exc) from exc\\\\n            await policy.sleep(attempts)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\\\n# 3) الطريقة الثانية: الديكور الموحّد @resilient (Breaker + Retry + Timeout)\\\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\\\n@resilient(\\\\n    name=\\\\\\\"checkout\\\\\\\",\\\\n    failure_threshold=2,\\\\n    recovery_timeout=1.5,\\\\n    half_open_max_calls=1,\\\\n    max_attempts=4,\\\\n    base_delay=0.1,\\\\n    multiplier=2.0,\\\\n    max_delay=0.8,\\\\n    jitter=0.1,\\\\n    timeout=1.0,\\\\n)\\\\nasync def checkout(gateway: FakePaymentGateway, amount: float) -> dict:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"دفع الطلب — محمي بالكامل: breaker + retry + timeout.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    return await gateway.charge(amount)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nasync def call_with_resilient_decorator(gateway: FakePaymentGateway) -> None:\\\\n    print()\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 64)\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"السيناريو (ب): الديكور @resilient — Breaker + Retry + Timeout\\\\\\\")\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 64)\\\\n\\\\n    # نلحق callback لتتبع تغيّر الحالة\\\\n    async def watch(old, new):\\\\n        print(f\\\\\\\"   ⚡ [checkout] الدائرة: {old.value} -> {new.value}\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    # الديكور يفضح الكائن الداخلي عبر fn.resilient\\\\n    checkout.resilient.breaker.on_state_change(lambda o, n: None)  # placeholder\\\\n    # نستخدم بديلاً متزامناً بسيطاً للتتبع:\\\\n    def sync_watch(old, new):\\\\n        print(f\\\\\\\"   ⚡ [checkout] الدائرة: {old.value} -> {new.value}\\\\\\\")\\\\n    checkout.resilient.breaker.on_state_change(sync_watch)\\\\n\\\\n    for i in range(8):\\\\n        try:\\\\n            result = await checkout(gateway, 199.0)\\\\n            print(f\\\\\\\"   ✓ عملية #{i + 1}: نجحت -> {result}\\\\\\\")\\\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\\\n            print(f\\\\\\\"   ✗ عملية #{i + 1}: CircuitOpenError — عرض رسالة 'الخدمة غير متاحة مؤقتاً'\\\\\\\")\\\\n        except RetryExhaustedError as exc:\\\\n            print(f\\\\\\\"   ✗ عملية #{i + 1}: استنفدت المحاولات — {exc.last_exc!r}\\\\\\\")\\\\n        except TimeoutError:\\\\n            print(f\\\\\\\"   ✗ عملية #{i + 1}: انتهت المهلة الزمنية\\\\\\\")\\\\n        print(f\\\\\\\"      [state={checkout.resilient.breaker.state.value}, \\\\\\\"\\\\n              f\\\\\\\"failures={checkout.resilient.breaker.failure_count}]\\\\\\\")\\\\n        await asyncio.sleep(0.25)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\\\n# 4) محاكاة تدفق متزامن (burst) لإظهار الحماية تحت الضغط\\\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\\\nasync def concurrent_burst(gateway: FakePaymentGateway) -> None:\\\\n    print()\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 64)\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"السيناريو (ج): 20 طلباً متزامناً نحو خدمة معطّلة تماماً\\\\\\\")\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"=\\\\\\\" * 64)\\\\n\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\\\n        name=\\\\\\\"burst\\\\\\\",\\\\n        failure_threshold=3,\\\\n        recovery_timeout=0.5,\\\\n        half_open_max_calls=1,\\\\n    )\\\\n\\\\n    async def task(i: int) -> str:\\\\n        try:\\\\n            await breaker.call(gateway.charge, float(i))\\\\n            return f\\\\\\\"task-{i}: ok\\\\\\\"\\\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\\\n            return f\\\\\\\"task-{i}: REJECTED (fail-fast)\\\\\\\"\\\\n        except Exception:\\\\n            return f\\\\\\\"task-{i}: failed\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*(task(i) for i in range(20)))\\\\n    ok = sum(1 for r in results if r.endswith(\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\"))\\\\n    rejected = sum(1 for r in results if \\\\\\\"REJECTED\\\\\\\" in r)\\\\n    failed = sum(1 for r in results if r.endswith(\\\\\\\"failed\\\\\\\"))\\\\n    print(f\\\\\\\"   النتائج: {ok} نجحت | {failed} فشلت | {rejected} رُفضت فوراً (fail-fast)\\\\\\\")\\\\n    print(f\\\\\\\"   إحصائيات الـ Breaker: {breaker.stats()}\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nasync def main() -> None:\\\\n    random.seed(42)  # نتائج قابلة للتكرار\\\\n    gateway = FakePaymentGateway(failure_rate=0.55, latency=0.25)\\\\n\\\\n    await call_with_manual_composition(gateway)\\\\n    await call_with_resilient_decorator(gateway)\\\\n    await concurrent_burst(gateway)\\\\n\\\\n    print()\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"الإحصائيات النهائية للبوابة:\\\\\\\")\\\\n    print(f\\\\\\\"   إجمالي الطلبات التي وصلت للبوابة: {gateway.requests}\\\\\\\")\\\\n    print(f\\\\\\\"   الناجحة منها: {gateway.successes}\\\\\\\")\\\\n    print(\\\\\\\"   (لاحظ أن fail-fast منع جزءاً كبيراً من الطلبات من الوصول للبوابة أصلاً)\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nif __name__ == \\\\\\\"__main__\\\\\\\":\\\\n    asyncio.run(main())\\\\n\\\", \\\"file_path\\\": \\\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py\\\"}\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:46:49.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:03.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":14},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":3,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:03.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_Ab1vTawGxKRtZmlhl6Em9380\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nDemo: Circuit Breaker + Retry (Exponential Backoff) مع asyncio.\\n\\nنحاكي خدمة خارجية غير مستقرة (HTTP API) ونحميها بطبقات المرونة الثلاث:\\n  1) Circuit Breaker  -> يوقف الضرب على الخدمة عند تكرار الفشل (fail-fast).\\n  2) Retry            -> يعيد المحاولة مع تأخير أُسّي (exponential backoff) + جitter.\\n  3) Timeout          -> مهلة زمنية لكل محاولة حتى لا يعلق الطلب للأبد.\\n\\nشغّل المثال:  python examples/demo.py\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nimport asyncio\\nimport random\\nimport sys\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\n# نضيف جذر المشروع إلى مسار الاستيراد حتى يعمل المثال من أي مكان\\nsys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent))\\n\\nfrom circuit_breaker import (\\n    CircuitBreaker,\\n    CircuitOpenError,\\n    RetryExhaustedError,\\n    RetryPolicy,\\n    resilient,\\n)\\n\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\n# 1) محاكاة خدمة خارجية غير مستقرة\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\nclass FakePaymentGateway:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"محاكاة بوابة دفع: نسبة فشل عشوائية + أوقات استجابة متفاوتة.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    def __init__(self, failure_rate: float = 0.6, latency: float = 0.3) -> None:\\n        self.failure_rate = failure_rate\\n        self.latency = latency\\n        self.requests = 0\\n        self.successes = 0\\n\\n    async def charge(self, amount: float, currency: str = \\\"USD\\\") -> dict:\\n        await asyncio.sleep(random.uniform(0.05, self.latency))\\n        self.requests += 1\\n        if random.random() < self.failure_rate:\\n            raise ConnectionError(\\\"upstream gateway timeout (simulated)\\\")\\n        self.successes += 1\\n        return {\\\"status\\\": \\\"ok\\\", \\\"amount\\\": amount, \\\"currency\\\": currency}\\n\\n\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\n# 2) الطريقة الأولى: التجميع اليدوي (CircuitBreaker + RetryPolicy)\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\nasync def call_with_manual_composition(gateway: FakePaymentGateway) -> None:\\n    print(\\\"=\\\" * 64)\\n    print(\\\"السيناريو (أ): تجميع يدوي — Breaker + RetryPolicy معاً\\\")\\n    print(\\\"=\\\" * 64)\\n\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\n        name=\\\"gateway-manual\\\",\\n        failure_threshold=3,       # ينفتح الدائرة بعد 3 إخفاقات متتالية\\n        recovery_timeout=2.0,      # ينتظر ثانيتين قبل السماح بمحاولة تجريبية\\n        half_open_max_calls=2,     # محاولتان تجريبيتان فقط في حالة HALF_OPEN\\n    )\\n    policy = RetryPolicy(\\n        max_attempts=5,            # 5 محاولات كحد أقصى\\n        base_delay=0.1,\\n        multiplier=2.0,\\n        max_delay=1.0,\\n        jitter=0.2,\\n    )\\n\\n    breaker.on_state_change(\\n        lambda old, new: print(f\\\"   ⚡ تغيّرت حالة الدائرة: {old} -> {new}\\\")\\n    )\\n\\n    attempts = 0\\n    while attempts < 12:\\n        attempts += 1\\n        try:\\n            result = await policy_retry_breaker(gateway, breaker, policy)\\n            print(f\\\"   ✓ محاولة #{attempts}: نجحت -> {result}\\\")\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\n            print(f\\\"   ✗ محاولة #{attempts}: CircuitOpenError (fail-fast، لا نلمس الخدمة!)\\\")\\n        except RetryExhaustedError as exc:\\n            print(f\\\"   ✗ محاولة #{attempts}: RetryExhaustedError — آخر خطأ: {exc.last_exc!r}\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"      [state={breaker.state.value}, failures={breaker.failure_count}]\\\")\\n        await asyncio.sleep(0.3)\\n\\n\\nasync def policy_retry_breaker(\\n    gateway: FakePaymentGateway,\\n    breaker: CircuitBreaker,\\n    policy: RetryPolicy,\\n) -> dict:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"محاولة واحدة = محاولات Retry تمر كلها عبر الـ Breaker.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    attempts = 0\\n    while True:\\n        try:\\n            return await breaker.call(gateway.charge, 99.5, currency=\\\"USD\\\")\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\n            raise  # الدائرة مفتوحة -> لا نعيد المحاولة، نفشل فوراً\\n        except Exception as exc:\\n            attempts += 1\\n            if attempts >= policy.max_attempts:\\n                raise RetryExhaustedError(attempts, exc) from exc\\n            await policy.sleep(attempts)\\n\\n\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\n# 3) الطريقة الثانية: الديكور الموحّد @resilient (Breaker + Retry + Timeout)\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\n@resilient(\\n    name=\\\"checkout\\\",\\n    failure_threshold=2,\\n    recovery_timeout=1.5,\\n    half_open_max_calls=1,\\n    max_attempts=4,\\n    base_delay=0.1,\\n    multiplier=2.0,\\n    max_delay=0.8,\\n    jitter=0.1,\\n    timeout=1.0,\\n)\\nasync def checkout(gateway: FakePaymentGateway, amount: float) -> dict:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"دفع الطلب — محمي بالكامل: breaker + retry + timeout.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return await gateway.charge(amount)\\n\\n\\nasync def call_with_resilient_decorator(gateway: FakePaymentGateway) -> None:\\n    print()\\n    print(\\\"=\\\" * 64)\\n    print(\\\"السيناريو (ب): الديكور @resilient — Breaker + Retry + Timeout\\\")\\n    print(\\\"=\\\" * 64)\\n\\n    # نلحق callback لتتبع تغيّر الحالة\\n    async def watch(old, new):\\n        print(f\\\"   ⚡ [checkout] الدائرة: {old.value} -> {new.value}\\\")\\n\\n    # الديكور يفضح الكائن الداخلي عبر fn.resilient\\n    checkout.resilient.breaker.on_state_change(lambda o, n: None)  # placeholder\\n    # نستخدم بديلاً متزامناً بسيطاً للتتبع:\\n    def sync_watch(old, new):\\n        print(f\\\"   ⚡ [checkout] الدائرة: {old.value} -> {new.value}\\\")\\n    checkout.resilient.breaker.on_state_change(sync_watch)\\n\\n    for i in range(8):\\n        try:\\n            result = await checkout(gateway, 199.0)\\n            print(f\\\"   ✓ عملية #{i + 1}: نجحت -> {result}\\\")\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\n            print(f\\\"   ✗ عملية #{i + 1}: CircuitOpenError — عرض رسالة 'الخدمة غير متاحة مؤقتاً'\\\")\\n        except RetryExhaustedError as exc:\\n            print(f\\\"   ✗ عملية #{i + 1}: استنفدت المحاولات — {exc.last_exc!r}\\\")\\n        except TimeoutError:\\n            print(f\\\"   ✗ عملية #{i + 1}: انتهت المهلة الزمنية\\\")\\n        print(f\\\"      [state={checkout.resilient.breaker.state.value}, \\\"\\n              f\\\"failures={checkout.resilient.breaker.failure_count}]\\\")\\n        await asyncio.sleep(0.25)\\n\\n\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\n# 4) محاكاة تدفق متزامن (burst) لإظهار الحماية تحت الضغط\\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #\\nasync def concurrent_burst(gateway: FakePaymentGateway) -> None:\\n    print()\\n    print(\\\"=\\\" * 64)\\n    print(\\\"السيناريو (ج): 20 طلباً متزامناً نحو خدمة معطّلة تماماً\\\")\\n    print(\\\"=\\\" * 64)\\n\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\n        name=\\\"burst\\\",\\n        failure_threshold=3,\\n        recovery_timeout=0.5,\\n        half_open_max_calls=1,\\n    )\\n\\n    async def task(i: int) -> str:\\n        try:\\n            await breaker.call(gateway.charge, float(i))\\n            return f\\\"task-{i}: ok\\\"\\n        except CircuitOpenError:\\n            return f\\\"task-{i}: REJECTED (fail-fast)\\\"\\n        except Exception:\\n            return f\\\"task-{i}: failed\\\"\\n\\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*(task(i) for i in range(20)))\\n    ok = sum(1 for r in results if r.endswith(\\\"ok\\\"))\\n    rejected = sum(1 for r in results if \\\"REJECTED\\\" in r)\\n    failed = sum(1 for r in results if r.endswith(\\\"failed\\\"))\\n    print(f\\\"   النتائج: {ok} نجحت | {failed} فشلت | {rejected} رُفضت فوراً (fail-fast)\\\")\\n    print(f\\\"   إحصائيات الـ Breaker: {breaker.stats()}\\\")\\n\\n\\nasync def main() -> None:\\n    random.seed(42)  # نتائج قابلة للتكرار\\n    gateway = FakePaymentGateway(failure_rate=0.55, latency=0.25)\\n\\n    await call_with_manual_composition(gateway)\\n    await call_with_resilient_decorator(gateway)\\n    await concurrent_burst(gateway)\\n\\n    print()\\n    print(\\\"الإحصائيات النهائية للبوابة:\\\")\\n    print(f\\\"   إجمالي الطلبات التي وصلت للبوابة: {gateway.requests}\\\")\\n    print(f\\\"   الناجحة منها: {gateway.successes}\\\")\\n    print(\\\"   (لاحظ أن fail-fast منع جزءاً كبيراً من الطلبات من الوصول للبوابة أصلاً)\\\")\\n\\n\\nif __name__ == \\\"__main__\\\":\\n    asyncio.run(main())\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py\",\"__result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py\"},\"result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:03.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:06.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_Ab1vTawGxKRtZmlhl6Em9380\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"content\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:06.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:06.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"Wait, I left some junk in the demo - there's an unused `async def watch` and a placeholder call. Let me clean that up. Let me fix the demo file.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:07.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:07.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":0},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"دعني أنظف بعض الأسطر الزائدة في المثال:\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:07.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:07.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":3,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:09.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_XFUEKuhFaYlPlqbX3j7m2014\",\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"args\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py\",\"old_string\":\"    # نلحق callback لتتبع تغيّر الحالة\\n    async def watch(old, new):\\n        print(f\\\"   ⚡ [checkout] الدائرة: {old.value} -> {new.value}\\\")\\n\\n    # الديكور يفضح الكائن الداخلي عبر fn.resilient\\n    checkout.resilient.breaker.on_state_change(lambda o, n: None)  # placeholder\\n    # نستخدم بديلاً متزامناً بسيطاً للتتبع:\\n    def sync_watch(old, new):\\n        print(f\\\"   ⚡ [checkout] الدائرة: {old.value} -> {new.value}\\\")\\n    checkout.resilient.breaker.on_state_change(sync_watch)\",\"new_string\":\"    # الديكور يفضح الكائنات الداخلية عبر fn.resilient — نلحق callback لتتبع الحالة\\n    def sync_watch(old, new):\\n        print(f\\\"   ⚡ [checkout] الدائرة: {old.value} -> {new.value}\\\")\\n\\n    checkout.resilient.breaker.on_state_change(sync_watch)\",\"__result\":\"Successfully replaced 1 instance(s) of the string in '/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py'\"},\"result\":\"Successfully replaced 1 instance(s) of the string in '/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py'\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:09.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:10.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_XFUEKuhFaYlPlqbX3j7m2014\",\"name\":\"edit_file\",\"content\":\"Successfully replaced 1 instance(s) of the string in '/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/examples/demo.py'\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:10.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:10.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"Also, in `call_with_manual_composition` I wrote a while loop calling `policy_retry_breaker`. That's fine. But there's an issue: within one \\\"attempt\\\" we do retries up to 5 times, each failing will record failure to breaker. With failure_threshold=3, after 3 failures the breaker opens. Then the next retry inside `policy_retry_breaker` raises CircuitOpenError which we re-raise immediately. Good.\\n\\nNow let me write the tests. Then run them.\\n\\nAlso I need to create `pyproject.toml` and possibly `pytest.ini`. Let me write tests now.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:11.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:13.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":2},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"الآن أكتب اختبارات الوحدة الشاملة:\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:13.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:13.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"اختبارات مشتركة — مرافق مساعدة لاختبارات الوحدة.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nimport asyncio\\\\nfrom typing import Awaitable, Callable, Optional, TypeVar\\\\n\\\\nT = TypeVar(\\\\\\\"T\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef run(coro_factory: Callable[[], Awaitable[T]], timeout: float = 15.0) -> T:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"تشغيل اختبار غير متزامن داخل حلقة asyncio جديدة (متوافق مع pytest).\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    return asyncio.run(asyncio.wait_for(coro_factory(), timeout=timeout))\\\\n\\\\n\\\\nclass FakeDependency:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"محاكاة خدمة خارجية بسلوك قابل للبرمجة.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\\\\n        self.calls = 0\\\\n        self.results: list = []\\\\n        self.exceptions: list = []\\\\n        self._mode = \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    def set_mode(self, mode: str) -> None:\\\\n        self._mode = mode\\\\n\\\\n    def set_results(self, results: list) -> None:\\\\n        self._mode = \\\\\\\"script\\\\\\\"\\\\n        self._script = list(results)\\\\n\\\\n    async def call(self) -> Optional[str]:\\\\n        self.calls += 1\\\\n        if self._mode == \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\":\\\\n            return \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\"\\\\n        if self._mode == \\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\":\\\\n            raise ConnectionError(\\\\\\\"simulated dependency failure\\\\\\\")\\\\n        if self._mode == \\\\\\\"script\\\\\\\":\\\\n            item = self._script.pop(0)\\\\n            if isinstance(item, Exception):\\\\n                raise item\\\\n            return item\\\\n        raise AssertionError(f\\\\\\\"unknown mode {self._mode!r}\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\", \\\"file_path\\\": \\\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/conftest.py\\\"}{\\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"اختبارات Circuit Breaker: الانتقالات بين الحالات الثلاث.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nimport asyncio\\\\nimport time\\\\n\\\\nimport pytest\\\\n\\\\nfrom circuit_breaker import CircuitBreaker, CircuitOpenError, CircuitState\\\\n\\\\nfrom .conftest import FakeDependency, run\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_initial_state_is_closed() -> None:\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker()\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\\\n    assert not breaker.is_open\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_closed_state_opens_after_threshold_failures() -> None:\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    for _ in range(2):\\\\n        with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\\\n            run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n        assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\\\n\\\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 3\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_open_state_rejects_calls_fast() -> None:\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\\\n\\\\n    calls_before = dep.calls\\\\n    with pytest.raises(CircuitOpenError):\\\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    # الخدمة لم تُلمس إطلاقاً\\\\n    assert dep.calls == calls_before\\\\n    assert breaker.rejected_calls == 1\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_open_transitions_to_half_open_after_cooldown() -> None:\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=0.05)\\\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\\\n\\\\n    time.sleep(0.1)\\\\n    # المحاولة التجريبية تنجح -> تغلق الدائرة\\\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\")\\\\n    result = run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    assert result == \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\"\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 0\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_half_open_failure_reopens_circuit() -> None:\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=0.05)\\\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\\\n\\\\n    time.sleep(0.1)\\\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    # المحاولة التجريبية فشلت -> عُدنا إلى OPEN\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 2\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_half_open_limits_concurrent_trials() -> None:\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\\\n        failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=0.05, half_open_max_calls=1\\\\n    )\\\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\\\n\\\\n    time.sleep(0.1)\\\\n\\\\n    async def two_concurrent_calls() -> list:\\\\n        dep.set_mode(\\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\")  # سننجح، لكن يجب ألا يتجاوز تيار واحد فقط\\\\n\\\\n        started = asyncio.Event()\\\\n\\\\n        async def slow_call():\\\\n            started.set()\\\\n            await asyncio.sleep(0.2)\\\\n            return await breaker.call(dep.call)\\\\n\\\\n        # الأول يدخل HALF_OPEN ويحجز الفتحة، الثاني يجب أن يُرفض\\\\n        t1 = asyncio.create_task(slow_call())\\\\n        await started.wait()\\\\n        with pytest.raises(CircuitOpenError):\\\\n            await breaker.call(dep.call)\\\\n        await t1\\\\n        return [breaker.state, dep.calls]\\\\n\\\\n    state, calls = run(two_concurrent_calls)\\\\n    assert state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\\\n    assert calls == 1  # لم يدخل سوى تيار واحد فعلياً\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_success_resets_failure_counter() -> None:\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\\\\\"script\\\\\\\")\\\\n    dep.set_results([ConnectionError(\\\\\\\"x\\\\\\\"), ConnectionError(\\\\\\\"x\\\\\\\"), \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\"])\\\\n\\\\n    for _ in range(2):\\\\n        with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\\\n            run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 2\\\\n\\\\n    # نجاح يعيد العدّاد إلى الصفر\\\\n    run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 0\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_non_matching_exception_does_not_affect_breaker() -> None:\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\\\n        failure_threshold=2, recovery_timeout=60.0,\\\\n        exceptions=(TimeoutError,),\\\\n    )\\\\n\\\\n    async def boom():\\\\n        raise ValueError(\\\\\\\"not counted\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    with pytest.raises(ValueError):\\\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(boom))\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 0\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_state_change_callback_invoked() -> None:\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\\\n    transitions: list[tuple[CircuitState, CircuitState]] = []\\\\n    breaker.on_state_change(lambda old, new: transitions.append((old, new)))\\\\n\\\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\")\\\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\\\n\\\\n    assert transitions == [(CircuitState.CLOSED, CircuitState.OPEN)]\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_concurrent_calls_are_thread_safe() -> None:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"ضغط متزامن: يجب ألا يتجاوز الـ Breaker عتبة الفتح أو يغلق بشكل خاطئ.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\\\n\\\\n    async def hammer():\\\\n        async def one(i: int) -> str:\\\\n            try:\\\\n                await breaker.call(_async_fail)\\\\n                return \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\"\\\\n            except Exception:\\\\n                return \\\\\\\"fail\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n        results = await asyncio.gather(*(one(i) for i in range(50)))\\\\n        return results\\\\n\\\\n    async def _async_fail():\\\\n        raise ConnectionError(\\\\\\\"boom\\\\\\\")\\\\n\\\\n    run(hammer)\\\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_decorator_exposes_breaker() -> None:\\\\n    from circuit_breaker import circuit\\\\n\\\\n    @circuit(name=\\\\\\\"deco\\\\\\\", failure_threshold=2, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\\\n    async def fetch() -> str:\\\\n        return \\\\\\\"data\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    assert fetch.circuit_breaker.name == \\\\\\\"deco\\\\\\\"\\\\n    assert run(fetch) == \\\\\\\"data\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\", \\\"file_path\\\": \\\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/test_circuit_breaker.py\\\"}\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:13.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:24.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":11},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":5,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:24.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_A7XJgokdReUylkeMJhDq4148\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"اختبارات مشتركة — مرافق مساعدة لاختبارات الوحدة.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nimport asyncio\\nfrom typing import Awaitable, Callable, Optional, TypeVar\\n\\nT = TypeVar(\\\"T\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef run(coro_factory: Callable[[], Awaitable[T]], timeout: float = 15.0) -> T:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"تشغيل اختبار غير متزامن داخل حلقة asyncio جديدة (متوافق مع pytest).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return asyncio.run(asyncio.wait_for(coro_factory(), timeout=timeout))\\n\\n\\nclass FakeDependency:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"محاكاة خدمة خارجية بسلوك قابل للبرمجة.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n    def __init__(self) -> None:\\n        self.calls = 0\\n        self.results: list = []\\n        self.exceptions: list = []\\n        self._mode = \\\"ok\\\"\\n\\n    def set_mode(self, mode: str) -> None:\\n        self._mode = mode\\n\\n    def set_results(self, results: list) -> None:\\n        self._mode = \\\"script\\\"\\n        self._script = list(results)\\n\\n    async def call(self) -> Optional[str]:\\n        self.calls += 1\\n        if self._mode == \\\"ok\\\":\\n            return \\\"ok\\\"\\n        if self._mode == \\\"fail\\\":\\n            raise ConnectionError(\\\"simulated dependency failure\\\")\\n        if self._mode == \\\"script\\\":\\n            item = self._script.pop(0)\\n            if isinstance(item, Exception):\\n                raise item\\n            return item\\n        raise AssertionError(f\\\"unknown mode {self._mode!r}\\\")\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/conftest.py\",\"__result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/conftest.py\"},\"result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/conftest.py\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:24.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:26.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_01_FI0HTu83zSmGy3mHy70G8438\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"args\":{\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"اختبارات Circuit Breaker: الانتقالات بين الحالات الثلاث.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nimport asyncio\\nimport time\\n\\nimport pytest\\n\\nfrom circuit_breaker import CircuitBreaker, CircuitOpenError, CircuitState\\n\\nfrom .conftest import FakeDependency, run\\n\\n\\ndef test_initial_state_is_closed() -> None:\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker()\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\n    assert not breaker.is_open\\n\\n\\ndef test_closed_state_opens_after_threshold_failures() -> None:\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\"fail\\\")\\n\\n    for _ in range(2):\\n        with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\n            run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n        assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\n\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 3\\n\\n\\ndef test_open_state_rejects_calls_fast() -> None:\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\"fail\\\")\\n\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\n\\n    calls_before = dep.calls\\n    with pytest.raises(CircuitOpenError):\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    # الخدمة لم تُلمس إطلاقاً\\n    assert dep.calls == calls_before\\n    assert breaker.rejected_calls == 1\\n\\n\\ndef test_open_transitions_to_half_open_after_cooldown() -> None:\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=0.05)\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\"fail\\\")\\n\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\n\\n    time.sleep(0.1)\\n    # المحاولة التجريبية تنجح -> تغلق الدائرة\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\"ok\\\")\\n    result = run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    assert result == \\\"ok\\\"\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 0\\n\\n\\ndef test_half_open_failure_reopens_circuit() -> None:\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=0.05)\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\"fail\\\")\\n\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\n\\n    time.sleep(0.1)\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    # المحاولة التجريبية فشلت -> عُدنا إلى OPEN\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 2\\n\\n\\ndef test_half_open_limits_concurrent_trials() -> None:\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\n        failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=0.05, half_open_max_calls=1\\n    )\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\"fail\\\")\\n\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\n\\n    time.sleep(0.1)\\n\\n    async def two_concurrent_calls() -> list:\\n        dep.set_mode(\\\"ok\\\")  # سننجح، لكن يجب ألا يتجاوز تيار واحد فقط\\n\\n        started = asyncio.Event()\\n\\n        async def slow_call():\\n            started.set()\\n            await asyncio.sleep(0.2)\\n            return await breaker.call(dep.call)\\n\\n        # الأول يدخل HALF_OPEN ويحجز الفتحة، الثاني يجب أن يُرفض\\n        t1 = asyncio.create_task(slow_call())\\n        await started.wait()\\n        with pytest.raises(CircuitOpenError):\\n            await breaker.call(dep.call)\\n        await t1\\n        return [breaker.state, dep.calls]\\n\\n    state, calls = run(two_concurrent_calls)\\n    assert state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\n    assert calls == 1  # لم يدخل سوى تيار واحد فعلياً\\n\\n\\ndef test_success_resets_failure_counter() -> None:\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\"script\\\")\\n    dep.set_results([ConnectionError(\\\"x\\\"), ConnectionError(\\\"x\\\"), \\\"ok\\\", \\\"ok\\\"])\\n\\n    for _ in range(2):\\n        with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\n            run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 2\\n\\n    # نجاح يعيد العدّاد إلى الصفر\\n    run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 0\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\n\\n\\ndef test_non_matching_exception_does_not_affect_breaker() -> None:\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(\\n        failure_threshold=2, recovery_timeout=60.0,\\n        exceptions=(TimeoutError,),\\n    )\\n\\n    async def boom():\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"not counted\\\")\\n\\n    with pytest.raises(ValueError):\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(boom))\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.CLOSED\\n    assert breaker.failure_count == 0\\n\\n\\ndef test_state_change_callback_invoked() -> None:\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=1, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\n    transitions: list[tuple[CircuitState, CircuitState]] = []\\n    breaker.on_state_change(lambda old, new: transitions.append((old, new)))\\n\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\n    dep.set_mode(\\\"fail\\\")\\n    with pytest.raises(ConnectionError):\\n        run(lambda: breaker.call(dep.call))\\n\\n    assert transitions == [(CircuitState.CLOSED, CircuitState.OPEN)]\\n\\n\\ndef test_concurrent_calls_are_thread_safe() -> None:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"ضغط متزامن: يجب ألا يتجاوز الـ Breaker عتبة الفتح أو يغلق بشكل خاطئ.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    breaker = CircuitBreaker(failure_threshold=3, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\n\\n    async def hammer():\\n        async def one(i: int) -> str:\\n            try:\\n                await breaker.call(_async_fail)\\n                return \\\"ok\\\"\\n            except Exception:\\n                return \\\"fail\\\"\\n\\n        results = await asyncio.gather(*(one(i) for i in range(50)))\\n        return results\\n\\n    async def _async_fail():\\n        raise ConnectionError(\\\"boom\\\")\\n\\n    run(hammer)\\n    assert breaker.state is CircuitState.OPEN\\n\\n\\ndef test_decorator_exposes_breaker() -> None:\\n    from circuit_breaker import circuit\\n\\n    @circuit(name=\\\"deco\\\", failure_threshold=2, recovery_timeout=60.0)\\n    async def fetch() -> str:\\n        return \\\"data\\\"\\n\\n    assert fetch.circuit_breaker.name == \\\"deco\\\"\\n    assert run(fetch) == \\\"data\\\"\\n\",\"file_path\":\"/home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/test_circuit_breaker.py\",\"__result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/test_circuit_breaker.py\"},\"result\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/test_circuit_breaker.py\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:24.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:26.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_A7XJgokdReUylkeMJhDq4148\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"content\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/conftest.py\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:26.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:26.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_01_FI0HTu83zSmGy3mHy70G8438\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"content\":\"Updated file /home/daytona/asyncio_circuit_breaker/tests/test_circuit_breaker.py\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:26.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:26.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"There's an issue in `test_half_open_limits_concurrent_trials` and in the hammer test. Let me double check the logic.\\n\\nIn `test_half_open_limits_concurrent_trials`:\\n- breaker trips to OPEN after 1 failure.\\n- sleep 0.1 (> recovery_timeout 0.05).\\n- Then `two_concurrent_calls`: sets dep mode to \\\"ok\\\". Creates task t1 = slow_call() which awaits `started.set()` then sleeps 0.2 then calls breaker.call.\\n- Wait for started. Then `await breaker.call(dep.call)` — the breaker should be HALF_OPEN with half_open_used=1 (t1 took the slot). So the second call raises CircuitOpenError. \\n- Then await t1 — t1's call succeeds, transitioning to CLOSED.\\n\\nBut wait: when `slow_call` runs `breaker.call`, `_try_acquire_permission` will check state OPEN, elapsed >= timeout -> transition to HALF_OPEN, half_open_used=0, then half_open_used=1, return True. Then it awaits dep.call (sleep 0.2 inside). Meanwhile main coroutine calls breaker.call -> state HALF_OPEN, half_open_used=1 >= 1 -> return False -> CircuitOpenError. Good.\\n\\nThen t1 completes: dep.call returns \\\"ok\\\", breaker._record_success -> HALF_OPEN -> CLOSED. dep.calls == 1. Good.\\n\\nBut there's a subtlety: `run(two_concurrent_calls)` uses asyncio.run, and inside, we create a task and await it. Fine.\\n\\nIn `test_concurrent_calls_are_thread_safe`: hammer creates 50 tasks each calling `_async_fail`. Wait — `_async_fail` is defined inside hammer as a nested async function `async def _async_fail()` but it's defined after `async def one(i)`. Actually Python closure: `_async_fail` is defined at the same scope as `one`, so `one` references it fine (defined before use at runtime since hammer's body executes top-down: `_async_fail` is defined before the gather call). Let me re-check the order:\\n\\n```python\\nasync def hammer():\\n    async def one(i: int) -> str:\\n        try:\\n            await breaker.call(_async_fail)\\n            return \\\"ok\\\"\\n        except Exception:\\n            return \\\"fail\\\"\\n\\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*(one(i) for i in range(50)))\\n    return results\\n\\nasync def _async_fail():\\n    raise ConnectionError(\\\"boom\\\")\\n```\\n\\n`_async_fail` is defined at module level after hammer — actually no, it's defined inside the test function after hammer. `one` captures `_async_fail` from the enclosing scope (test function scope). By the time `one` runs, `_async_fail` is defined. Fine. But it's a bit ugly. Actually `async def _async_fail()` is a regular (sync) function that returns a coroutine when called; `breaker.call(_async_fail)` calls `_async_fail()` which returns a coroutine, and `await func(*args)` awaits it. Good.\\n\\nEach failure increments failure_count. With 50 concurrent failures and threshold 3, breaker opens. Since all 50 run concurrently, the state transitions to OPEN during the burst. Some may raise CircuitOpenError (rejected), caught by except Exception. Fine. After gather, state is OPEN. Good.\\n\\nOne concern: in `test_open_transitions_to_half_open_after_cooldown`, after OPEN and sleep 0.1, call succeeds -> transitions to CLOSED. `_record_success` on HALF_OPEN: transition CLOSED, half_open_used=0, failure_count=0. Good.\\n\\nNow the retry tests and protected tests. Let me write them.{\\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"اختبارات سياسة Retry مع Exponential Backoff.\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nimport asyncio\\\\nimport time\\\\n\\\\nimport pytest\\\\n\\\\nfrom circuit_breaker import RetryExhaustedError, RetryPolicy, retry, retryable\\\\n\\\\nfrom .conftest import FakeDependency, run\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_success_on_first_attempt() -> None:\\\\n    dep = FakeDependency()\\\\n\\\\n    result = run(lambda: retry(dep.call, policy=RetryPolicy(max_attempts=3)))\\\\n    assert result == \\\\\\\"ok\\\\\\\"\\\\n    assert dep.calls == 1\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ndef test_retries_until_success() -> None:\\\\n    dep = FakeDependency\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T02:47:27.000Z\",\"endedAt\":null,\"thinkingSeconds\":6}],\"isStreaming\":true,\"isInterrupted\":false,\"generatedFiles\":[],\"conversation_id\":\"1d5a566a-aea8-49f8-9e7a-1d24a5b22643\",\"created_at\":1787626003418,\"fileInfo\":null,\"fileInfos\":null,\"modelValue\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"isAutoModel\":false,\"isStopped\":false,\"creditsUsed\":5}]}}"
          }
